  "content": "<h2><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fhoster24.org%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"font-weight:bold;color:#00f;font-size:24px\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/566412/description_22188d49-df21-4e21-ba83-cc6001713fa7.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"620\" height=\"96\"></a></h2>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><span style=\"color:#00f\">隱藏<span style=\"color:#f90\">與</span></span></span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><span style=\"color:#00f\"><span style=\"color:#f90\">尋找 <span style=\"color:#f00\">地圖</span></span></span></span></strong></p>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong><span style=\"color:#fff;text-decoration:underline\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">一款讓你遊玩捉迷藏</span></span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#fff;text-decoration:underline\">的地圖</span></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#fff\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">- 適合 2-4 名玩家</span></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h2><strong><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;color:#fff\">為什麼你應該下載這張地圖</span></strong></h2>\n<p><span style=\"color:#fff\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">- 在 3 張大地圖中遊玩（未來可能還會增加更多）</span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#fff\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">- 許多的躲藏地點</span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#fff\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">- 給予躲藏者充足的時間來隱藏</span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#fff\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">- 我們仍在持續更新這張地圖</span></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;color:#fff\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>如果你發現了錯誤該怎麼做</strong></span></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"color:#fff\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">如果你發現了錯誤，請留言或發送電子郵件至 Lenny230809@gmail.com</span></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h2><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;color:#fff\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>地圖中有遊戲模式嗎</strong></span></span></h2>\n<p><span style=\"color:#fff\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">地圖中有 2 種遊戲模式（普通模式 &amp; 方塊模式）</span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#fff\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">普通模式：普通的捉迷藏</span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#fff\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">方塊模式：普通的捉迷藏，但可以放置方塊</span></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h2><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;color:#fff\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>創作者</strong></span></span></h2>\n<p><span style=\"color:#fff\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">- Play it now (指揮官)</span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#fff\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">-&nbsp;lyfeyt2 (建築師)</span></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h2><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;color:#fff\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>未來的更新計畫</strong></span></span></h2>\n<p><span style=\"color:#fff\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">- 可能會增加超過 3 張地圖</span></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h1><span style=\"color:#000\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">&nbsp;<a href=\"https://discord.gg/twhqbCfdDP\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"color:#3cc\"><strong>Discord</strong></span></a></span></span></h1>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>也請查看我們的其它地圖</strong></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>宣傳影片：</strong></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/C1j6kkvrmvY?wmode=transparent\" width=\"788\" height=\"433\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></strong></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
